# Whitelist, not a blocklist: every *.html/*.yaml/*.yml file at the repo
# root is private-by-default (dashboard profiles hold real domains, ports,
# service layout) except the specific public files negated below. This
# means a new private profile (e.g. work.html + config.work.yaml) needs no
# entry here at all — it's already covered — while a new *public* one
# needs an explicit "!" line, which is a deliberate speed bump against
# accidentally publishing something real.
/*.html
/*.yaml
/*.yml
!/index.html
!/config.yaml
!/docker-compose.yml

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
